ter","text":"Craftable ER for consistent Bursts. Passive offers little to his support role."}],"a":[{"names":["Silken Moon's Serenade"],"text":"Team EM buff; limited before C2.","stats":"EM/ER · EM · EM/CR"},{"names":["Instructor"],"text":"Reaction EM buff; weaker stats.","stats":"EM/ER · EM · EM/CR"},{"names":["Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"text":"Buffs Geo and Hydro damage.","stats":"EM/ER · EM · EM/CR"}],"t":[{"name":"Moonlit Vanguard","members":["Illuga","Zibai","Columbina","Gorou"],"text":"Zibai deals direct Lunar-Crystallize damage; Columbina enables reactions, while Gorou and Illuga boost Geo output.","roles":["Geo Buffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer","DEF Buffer"]},{"name":"Lunar Bulwark","members":["Illuga","Zibai","Aino","Zhongli"],"text":"Aino provides Hydro for Zibai; Zhongli supplies shielding and RES shred as Illuga amplifies direct Geo damage.","roles":["Geo Buffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Enabler","Shielder / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Nightingale Chorus","members":["Illuga","Linnea","Columbina","Gorou"],"text":"Linnea drives Geo damage and enables Lunar-Crystallize; Columbina and Gorou support her alongside Illuga.","roles":["Geo Buffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer","DEF Buffer"]},{"name":"Probably Hopeless","members":["Illuga","Noelle","Furina","Gorou"],"text":"Noelle heals and drives Geo damage, enabling Furina buffs while Gorou and Illuga bolster her damage.","roles":["Geo Buffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer","DEF Buffer"]}],"v":"C0-C1 Moon: Silken Moon has limited uptime; consider Instructor or Scroll when teammates already hold it.\nC2+ Moon: Off-field Geo hits extend Silken Moon uptime. Build ER first, then maximize EM.\nGeo Support: For non-Lunar Geo DPS, use Noblesse if no teammate holds it; buffs are weaker than for Zibai.\nEnergy Hungry: Use Favonius Lance, ER Sands, or Kitain to Burst every rotation.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Support / Buffer"],"about":"Illuga is an off-field Geo buffer who strengthens Geo and direct Lunar-Crystallize damage through his Burst and passives. Build enough ER to Burst each rotation, then stack EM. He cannot enable Lunar-Crystallize by himself.","pros":["Strong Geo buffs","Excellent Zibai synergy","Simple rotations","Short cooldowns"],"cons":["Needs Lunar enabler","High ER demands","Low personal damage","C2 improves set uptime"],"weapons":["Favonius Lance","Dragon's Bane","Engulfing Lightning","Kitain Cross Spear","Frostbreath","Prototype Starglitter"],"arts":[{"sets":["Silken Moon's Serenade"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Best"},{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""}],"main":["Elemental Mastery / Energy Recharge","Elemental Mastery","Elemental Mastery / Crit Rate"],"stats":["ER: 160% - 200%","EM: 600 - 900","CR: 25% - 45%"],"vars":[{"title":"C0–C1 Alternative Support","role":"Off-field Support","weapons":["Favonius Lance","Dragon's Bane","Kitain Cross Spear"],"arts":[{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Reach ER needs first, then stack EM. Build CRIT Rate only for Favonius.","teams":"Lunar-Crystallize enabler such as Zibai, Linnea, or Columbina.","when":"Before C2, Silken Moon has shorter buff uptime. Use Instructor for team EM or Scroll for Geo/Hydro DMG bonuses.","cond":"Set buffs depend on reaction triggers and team composition.","notes":"Avoid duplicating an artifact set already supplied by a teammate.","pre":false},{"title":"Traditional Geo DPS Support","role":"Off-field Support","weapons":["Favonius Lance","Dragon's Bane","Kitain Cross Spear"],"arts":[{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["The Exile"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Prioritize Burst uptime and EM; Favonius needs some CRIT Rate.","teams":"An ATK-scaling Geo carry for Noblesse, or energy-hungry allies for Exile.","when":"Support Noelle, Itto, or Navia without relying on direct Lunar-Crystallize damage. His buffs are weaker outside Lunar teams.","cond":"Do not duplicate Noblesse on another teammate.","notes":"Noblesse is less valuable for DEF-scaling carries; Exile helps energy.","pre":false},{"title":"Low-Energy Accessible Build","role":"Off-field Support","weapons":["Kitain Cross Spear","Favonius Lance","Prototype Starglitter"],"arts":[{"sets":["Silken Moon's Serenade"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["The Exile"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Use an ER Sands if needed. Swap to EM Sands only after reliable Burst uptime.","teams":"Geo teammates or Favonius users help lower his energy requirements.","when":"For limited weapon rosters or rotations where Illuga cannot Burst reliably. Kitain is the accessible default.","cond":"Kitain refinements improve energy refund; ER depends on team and C1.","notes":"Do not prioritize raw ATK or personal CRIT damage over Burst uptime.","pre":false}],"mats":["Prithiva Topaz Sliver","Prithiva Topaz Fragment","Prithiva Topaz Chunk","Prithiva Topaz Gemstone","Cyclic Military Kuuvahki Core","Teachings of Elysium","Guide to Elysium","Philosophies of Elysium","Broken Drive Shaft","Reinforced Drive Shaft","Precision Drive Shaft","Pine Amber","Eroded Horn","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 6+"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Moonlit Vanguard","members":["Illuga","Zibai","Columbina","Gorou"]},{"name":"Lunar Bulwark","members":["Illuga","Zibai","Aino","Zhongli"]},{"name":"Nightingale Chorus","members":["Illuga","Linnea","Columbina","Gorou"]},{"name":"Probably Hopeless","members":["Illuga","Noelle","Furina","Gorou"]}]}}],"title":"Illuga","el":"Geo"}